graph TD
    Start([Vector Storage Decision]) --> Engine{Which Engine?}
    
    Engine -->|VIPER<br/>Columnar| ViperPath
    Engine -->|SST<br/>Row-based| SstPath
    
    subgraph ViperPath["VIPER: Quantization RECOMMENDED ✓"]
        VP1[Columnar Storage<br/>Read only what you need]
        VP2[Perfect for Quantization<br/>Separate columns for each type]
        
        VP1 --> VQuant{Quantization<br/>Strategy}
        
        VQuant -->|Write Quantized| VQ1[INT8/INT4 Column<br/>24x less I/O]
        VQuant -->|Write PQ Codes| VQ2[PQ Codes Column<br/>256B per vector]
