        VQ1 --> VBenefit1[Read only quantized<br/>for search]
        VQ2 --> VBenefit2[Read only PQ codes<br/>for candidates]
        VQ3 --> VBenefit3[Choose column<br/>based on query]
    end
    
    subgraph SstPath["SST: Quantization NOT RECOMMENDED ✗"]
        SP1[Row Storage<br/>Must read entire record]
