        SQuant -->|NO Quantization| SQ1[FP32 Only<br/>+ ZSTD Block Compression]
        SQuant -->|Has Quantization| SQ2[Forced to store both<br/>FP32 + Quantized]
        
        SQ1 --> SBenefit1[✓ Optimal I/O<br/>✓ 100% accuracy<br/>✓ 20-40% compression]
        SQ2 --> SBenefit2[✗ Wasted I/O<br/>✗ Storage overhead<br/>✗ Complexity]
    end
    
    subgraph Recommendations["Final Recommendations"]
